        {
          "text": "🧩 Fill-in-the-Blank Exercises",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "🧩 Fill-in-the-Blank Exercises"
        },
        {
          "text": "Complete each sentence with a word from this page.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Complete each sentence with a word from this page."
        },
        {
          "text": "1.  The __________ rushed to the scene with sirens blaring.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. The __________ rushed to the scene with sirens blaring."
        },
        {
          "text": "2.  Firefighters wear __________ jackets that can withstand extreme heat.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. Firefighters wear __________ jackets that can withstand extreme heat."
        },
        {
          "text": "3.  The smoke __________ went off in the middle of the night.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. The smoke __________ went off in the middle of the night."
        },
        {
          "text": "4.  She used a fire __________ to put out the small kitchen fire.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. She used a fire __________ to put out the small kitchen fire."
        },
        {
          "text": "5.  The __________ slid down the pole when the alarm sounded.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. The __________ slid down the pole when the alarm sounded."
        },
        {
          "text": "6.  The fire __________ gave a talk on home safety.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "6. The fire __________ gave a talk on home safety."
        },
        {
          "text": "7.  They connected the __________ to the hydrant and aimed water at the flames.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "7. They connected the __________ to the hydrant and aimed water at the flames."
        },
        {
          "text": "8.  Everyone must know the __________ plan in case of a fire.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "8. Everyone must know the __________ plan in case of a fire."
        },
        {
          "text": "9.  The building was __________ within ten minutes of the alarm.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "9. The building was __________ within ten minutes of the alarm."
        },
        {
          "text": "10. Firefighters wore breathing __________ to enter the smoky building.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "10. Firefighters wore breathing __________ to enter the smoky building."
        },
        {
          "text": "Answer Key",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Answer Key"
